  "steps": [
    {
      "zh": "用波兰种和牛奶汤种做主面团，总面粉 540 g。揉面用压叠手法，操作中追加 50 g 牛奶。",
      "en": "Make the main dough with the poolish and milk tangzhong (540 g total flour). Knead using a press-and-fold technique; add another 50 g of milk during mixing."
    },
    {
      "zh": "把馅料拌匀。整形中间松弛两次，各 30 分钟。加入芝麻馅并做成山形吐司。",
      "en": "Mix the filling. Rest the dough twice for 30 minutes each during shaping. Add the sesame filling and shape into mountain-top loaves."
    },
    {
      "zh": "原记录是「310 度烤 30 分钟」。出炉效果满意，第二天早上仍然柔软。",
      "en": "The original note says ‘bake at 310 degrees for 30 minutes.’ The result was good and still soft the next morning."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "zh": "温度单位待核，按美式烤箱推测为 °F。主面团牛奶总量、每条放入的馅量及发酵时间待补。",
